# Vanilla Minecraft Hoe Head - Accurate mesh model
# Based on hoe.json weapon profile
# All coordinates in centimeters
# Hoe oriented PERPENDICULAR to handle
#
# Dimensions from JSON (uses "pick" type with single spike):
# Eye: 60mm (6cm) length, 40mm (4cm) height, 20mm (2cm) thickness
# Front spike (blade): 180mm (18cm) length, 40mm (4cm) base width/height
# Rear spike: 0mm (no rear spike - this is what makes it a hoe)
#
# Coordinate system for perpendicular head:
# - X-axis: along the blade direction (primary axis)
# - Y-axis: handle direction (vertical when attached)
# - Z-axis: secondary horizontal (width)
# - Origin: center of eye where handle passes through

# ==============================================================
# EYE SECTION (central hub where handle passes through)
# Eye: 6cm long (X), 4cm tall (Y), 2cm thick (Z)
# ==============================================================

# Eye back edge (-X side, poll side)
v -3.0 -2.0 1.0
v -3.0 -2.0 -1.0
v -3.0 2.0 1.0
v -3.0 2.0 -1.0

# Eye front edge (+X side, where blade starts)
v 3.0 -2.0 1.0
v 3.0 -2.0 -1.0
v 3.0 2.0 1.0
v 3.0 2.0 -1.0

# ==============================================================
# HOE BLADE (extends in +X direction from eye)
# 18cm length, flat blade that tapers to edge
# Wider and flatter than a pickaxe spike
# ==============================================================

# Blade at 1/4 length (4.5cm from eye)
# Blade spreads wider (Y) but stays thin (Z)
v 7.5 -3.0 0.6
v 7.5 -3.0 -0.6
v 7.5 3.0 0.6
v 7.5 3.0 -0.6

# Blade at 1/2 length (9cm from eye)
# Full width, very flat
v 12.0 -4.0 0.4
v 12.0 -4.0 -0.4
v 12.0 4.0 0.4
v 12.0 4.0 -0.4

# Blade at 3/4 length (13.5cm from eye)
# Starting to taper toward edge
v 16.5 -3.5 0.2
v 16.5 -3.5 -0.2
v 16.5 3.5 0.2
v 16.5 3.5 -0.2

# Blade edge (21cm from origin = 3cm eye + 18cm blade)
# Thin cutting edge
v 21.0 -3.0 0.0
v 21.0 3.0 0.0

# ==============================================================
# POLL (back of hoe head - just the eye back face)
# ==============================================================
# (Poll is just the -X face of the eye, no additional geometry)

# ==============================================================
# FACES (triangles, CCW winding for outward normals)
# ==============================================================

# ---- EYE BACK FACE (poll) ----
f 1 3 4
f 1 4 2

# ---- EYE TOP FACE ----
f 3 7 8
f 3 8 4

# ---- EYE BOTTOM FACE ----
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5

# ---- EYE FRONT SIDE (+Z) ----
f 1 5 7
f 1 7 3

# ---- EYE BACK SIDE (-Z) ----
f 2 4 8
f 2 8 6

# ---- EYE to BLADE 1/4 ----
# Top transition (blade gets wider)
f 7 11 12
f 7 12 8
# Bottom transition
f 5 6 10
f 5 10 9
# Front side (+Z)
f 5 9 11
f 5 11 7
# Back side (-Z)
f 6 8 12
f 6 12 10

# ---- BLADE 1/4 to 1/2 ----
# Top
f 11 15 16
f 11 16 12
# Bottom
f 9 10 14
f 9 14 13
# Front (+Z)
f 9 13 15
f 9 15 11
# Back (-Z)
f 10 12 16
f 10 16 14

# ---- BLADE 1/2 to 3/4 ----
# Top
f 15 19 20
f 15 20 16
# Bottom
f 13 14 18
f 13 18 17
# Front (+Z)
f 13 17 19
f 13 19 15
# Back (-Z)
f 14 16 20
f 14 20 18

# ---- BLADE 3/4 to EDGE ----
# Top (converges to edge line)
f 19 22 20
# Bottom (converges to edge line)
f 17 18 21
# Front (+Z) - converges to edge
f 17 21 22
f 17 22 19
# Back (-Z) - converges to edge
f 18 20 22
f 18 22 21

# ---- EDGE (line between vertices 21 and 22) ----
# This is just a line, the triangular faces above create the edge
